SCOPE OF THE ABOVE

The MIT licence above covers only what the 1.6 port added:

  - the per-operation success flag on the 14 cat and dog operations
  - the patch operations in Patches/ColorfulCoats_VAEodyssey.xml, written for this
    port because Odyssey did not exist when purpleyam stopped. The coats and the
    chances they carry are purpleyam's, as below; only the aiming is mine
  - the showcase drawn for this port: About/Preview.png, About/ModIcon.png,
    and the Art/ sources and engraving page behind them
  - the test scenarios in TESTING.md and the checker under _tools/
  - the packaging and the documentation

IT DOES NOT COVER THE ORIGINAL MOD. The 74 coats, their chances and the 222
textures are purpleyam's work, reused here:

  https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2398446130

The investigation recorded in ATTRIBUTION.md on 2026-09-12 found no explicit
licence or redistribution permission in the sources examined. No licence for
these inherited assets is granted here. The workspace policy retains public /
silent / unofficial status, explicit credit, a link to the original and removal
on request; that policy does not establish the original author's permission.

The animals themselves are neither purpleyam's nor mine: they belong to Vanilla
Animals Expanded, by Oskar Potocki, Sarg Bjornson and Erin. This mod ships no
part of it and only patches it at load time.

If purpleyam asks for this to be taken down, it comes down. Immediately, and
without discussion.

ATTRIBUTION.md records what was taken and what was changed.
